<span id="cb19-25"><a href="#cb19-25" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>s_labor_m <span class="ot">&lt;-</span> gender_data_selected<span class="sc">$</span><span class="st">'Labor force participation rate for ages 15-24, male (%) (modeled ILO estimate)'</span></span>
