<section id="histogram" class="level2" data-number="7.3">
<h2 data-number="7.3" class="anchored" data-anchor-id="histogram"><span class="header-section-number">7.3</span> histogram</h2>
<p>The basic histogram is straightforward, but once again we may wish to enhance by techniques such as adjusting the fill color by the count of the data, illustrated below:</p>
