<section id="theme-tweaks" class="level2" data-number="7.9">
<h2 data-number="7.9" class="anchored" data-anchor-id="theme-tweaks"><span class="header-section-number">7.9</span> theme tweaks</h2>
<p>Here we simply illustrate a few ways of changing the theme look and feel. In general, the graphs are infinitely customizable. We also invoke options to adjust the color and palettes used for the plots.</p>
<div class="cell">
<details class="code-fold">
<summary>Code</summary>
<div class="code-copy-outer-scaffold"><div class="sourceCode cell-code" id="cb63"><pre class="sourceCode r code-with-copy"><code class="sourceCode r"><span id="cb63-1"><a href="#cb63-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="fu">ggplot</span>(gender_data_final, <span class="fu">aes</span>(<span class="at">x=</span>fertility, <span class="at">y=</span>gdp)) <span class="sc">+</span> <span class="fu">facet_grid</span>(.<span class="sc">~</span>female_high_labor) <span class="sc">+</span> <span class="fu">geom_point</span>(<span class="at">fill=</span><span class="st">"purple"</span>) <span class="sc">+</span> <span class="fu">theme</span>(<span class="at">panel.background =</span> <span class="fu">element_rect</span>(<span class="at">fill=</span><span class="st">'pink'</span>, <span class="at">colour=</span><span class="st">'green'</span>))</span></code></pre></div><button title="Copy to Clipboard" class="code-copy-button"><i class="bi"></i></button></div>
